# Copy to .env.local for local dev. In Netlify, set these as build environment
# variables (Site configuration > Environment variables) instead.
#
# Both come from your Supabase project: Settings > API. The anon key is
# public by design — Row Level Security on the `progress` table is what
# actually protects data, not secrecy of this key. Never put the
# service_role key here or anywhere in frontend code.
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
